---
// Editorial Methodology & Evaluation Standards Component
---

<section class="methodology-radar-section" id="radar-methodology" aria-labelledby="methodology-heading">
  <div class="methodology-inner">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="methodology-section-header">
      <div class="methodology-pill">
        <span>🔬 RIGOROUS EVALUATION STANDARD</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="methodology-heading" class="methodology-heading">
        Editorial Methodology & <span class="gradient-text">Scoring Transparency</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="methodology-subheading">
        How ToolsRadar systematically filters out ephemeral marketing hype to surface production-grade engineering tools with 100% independence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="methodology-grid">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="methodology-card">
        <div class="card-top-header">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-blue">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tag tag-blue">Discovery Pipeline</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Continuous Multi-Source Telemetry</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Automated ingestion pipelines monitor GitHub Trending, Hacker News (Show HN), and Product Hunt every 24 hours. We track organic commit acceleration, community forks, and grassroots engineering traction rather than PR announcements.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer-pill">
          <span class="dot-active"></span>
          <span>24H Cadence • 975+ Tracked</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="methodology-card">
        <div class="card-top-header">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-emerald">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tag tag-emerald">Code & Hygiene Audit</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Licensing & Self-Hostability Vetting</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Every candidate repository undergoes structural verification: OSI-approved licensing (MIT, Apache 2.0, BSD, AGPL), maintenance health (unresolved CVEs, release cadence), and containerized local Docker deployment without mandatory telemetry.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer-pill">
          <span class="dot-active" style="background: #10b981; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;"></span>
          <span>OSI Compliance • Air-Gapped Usability</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="methodology-card">
        <div class="card-top-header">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-purple">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tag tag-purple">Algorithmic Scoring</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">The 0–100 Traction Signal Score</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          We compute a balanced, multi-dimensional score to separate ephemeral star-farming from legitimate software adoption:
        </p>
        <div class="formula-snippet">
          <code>Signal = Stars(35%) + Commits(25%) + Community(20%) + Health(20%)</code>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-pill">
          <span class="dot-active" style="background: #a855f7; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #a855f7;"></span>
          <span>Score ≥ 80 = High-Velocity Breakout</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="methodology-card">
        <div class="card-top-header">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-amber">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <path d="M16 8h-6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8"></path>
              <line x1="12" y1="6" x2="12" y2="8"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-tag tag-amber">Editorial Neutrality</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">100% Zero-Payola Independence</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          ToolsRadar rejects sponsored reviews, paid rank boosts, and vendor pay-to-play listings. Every 4-chapter technical dossier and battleground comparison matrix is authored with strictly objective, developer-first engineering criteria.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer-pill">
          <span class="dot-active" style="background: #f59e0b; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #f59e0b;"></span>
          <span>Zero Paid Listings • 0% Commercial Bias</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Action Callout -->
    <div class="methodology-bottom-banner">
      <div class="banner-content">
        <span class="banner-icon">📋</span>
        <div class="banner-text">
          <strong>Need deeper technical auditing details?</strong>
          <span>Explore our full 5-pillar editorial framework, security review checklist, and community submission criteria.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="banner-actions">
        <a href="/methodology" class="btn-methodology-link">
          <span>Read Full Methodology</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/submit" class="btn-submit-link">
          <span>+ Submit Tool for Review</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .methodology-radar-section {
    margin: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .methodology-inner {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .methodology-section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .methodology-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }

  .methodology-heading {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .methodology-heading {
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .methodology-subheading {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8 0%, #818cf8 50%, #c084fc 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .methodology-subheading {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* 4 Pillars Grid */
  .methodology-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .methodology-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  .methodology-card {
    background: rgba(18, 18, 23, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .methodology-card {
      padding: 1.15rem;
    }
  }

  .methodology-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .card-top-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .methodology-card:hover .card-icon-wrap {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .icon-blue {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px -2px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
  }
  .icon-emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px -2px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
  }
  .icon-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px -2px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
  }
  .icon-amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px -2px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .tag-blue {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.22);
    color: #38bdf8;
  }
  .tag-emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.22);
    color: #10b981;
  }
  .tag-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.22);
    color: #c084fc;
  }
  .tag-amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.22);
    color: #fbbf24;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex: 1;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .card-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
  }

  .formula-snippet {
    background: #090a10;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .formula-snippet code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #a855f7;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
    display: block;
  }

  .card-footer-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .dot-active {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: #38bdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #38bdf8;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Bottom Banner */
  .methodology-bottom-banner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.06) 0%, rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.04) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .banner-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 240px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .banner-icon {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .banner-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .banner-text strong {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .banner-text span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .banner-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-methodology-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;
    background: #38bdf8;
    color: #040810;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .btn-methodology-link:hover {
    background: #7dd3fc;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    color: #040810;
  }

  .btn-submit-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .btn-submit-link:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .methodology-bottom-banner {
      padding: 1.1rem;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .banner-content {
      min-width: 0;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .banner-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-methodology-link, .btn-submit-link {
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
